<title>USA: N.Y. certificated cotton stocks rise to 197,023.</title>
<headline>N.Y. certificated cotton stocks rise to 197,023.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of June 2 totaled 197,023 bales compared with 196,276 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 803 bales issued, 1,558 bales awaiting review, 56 cancellations, and 4,653 decertification orders.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
